+## updating tracks
+
+```bash
+# update title
+plyrfm update 579 --title "new title"
+
+# update tags (replaces all tags)
+plyrfm update 579 --tags "ambient,ai"
+
+# update multiple fields
+plyrfm update 579 --title "鶴の舞" --tags "ambient,ai"
+```
